  - Charitable cash contributions are deductible only if you itemize (Schedule A). If you take the standard deduction you cannot deduct this $800 on the federal return.
- Unreimbursed employee expenses:
  - As noted above, these are NOT deductible for employees through 2025 under current law. If those $650 expenses are for your contracting business, they are deductible on Schedule C.
