- Charitable contributions:
  - $800 cash gift is deductible if you itemize on Schedule A. If you take the standard deduction, you cannot separately deduct that $800 on your federal return (unless a temporary special rule applies — none for 2024 general cash gifts).
- State & local taxes (SALT):
