- Additional: Form 1040‑ES (for estimated tax payments) — you should use this if you expect tax due and want to make quarterly estimated payments (to avoid penalties).

6) Other points and recommendations
- QBI deduction: Your net self‑employment income (after business expenses) may qualify for the 20% QBI deduction. With $15k gross it’s likely you’ll get something here; Form 8995 is typically used.
