2. Are the $650 “unreimbursed expenses” employee expenses (from an employer) or business expenses related to your contracting work?
3. Did you receive any 1099s from your contracting clients? If yes, do you have the amounts and forms?
4. Does the $480 from Interactive Brokers represent interest, dividends, or capital gains (do you have the 1099 from IB)?
5. Do you pay utilities, renter’s insurance, etc., and would you prefer me to estimate actual-method home-office allocation vs simplified method?
6. Any other itemizable items (state income tax or property tax >$10k, mortgage interest, large medical expenses)?

