- Self‑employment tax (approx): 92.35% × $11,150 × 15.3% ≈ $1,576 (estimate). Half of that (~$788) is an above‑the‑line deduction.
- Student loan interest: max deductible $2,500 (but only for interest paid in 2024 and subject to income phaseouts).
