- Net profit from Schedule C is subject to self‑employment tax. You’ll compute self‑employment tax on Schedule SE (approx. 15.3% on net earnings), but you can deduct half of the self‑employment tax as an adjustment to income (above-the-line deduction on Schedule 1).
